<title>FRANCE: Havas rises on GdesEaux link.</title>
<headline>Havas rises on GdesEaux link.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Havas were outperforming the market on Friday in active volume as investors are starting to expect a better valuation for the group following the increased stake by Generale des Eaux, fund managers said.</p>
<p>One manager also said that a call warrant issue on Havas by ABN Amro could underpin the market.</p>
<p>Havas was 1.29 percent higher at 472.70 francs at 1254 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the Messier effect (the chairman of Generale des Eaux). We expect him to improve the value of the share via restructurings,&quot; a fund manager said.</p>
</text>
